WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.210
Two roads climb towards the same summit.

2
00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.640
One is steep and direct.

3
00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:09.070
The other winds on for
countless lifetimes.

4
00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.470
Its traveller makes a
vow: to become a Buddha,

5
00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:15.270
in order to free all beings.

6
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:20.380
So is the goal to end your own craving,
or to become a Buddha for everyone?

7
00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:23.930
In this mission, you'll meet
the arhat, the 'worthy one',

8
00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:26.900
and climb the four stages to that goal.

9
00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:31.290
Then you'll meet the bodhisattva, and
follow Amida's vow to a land called the

10
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:32.680
Pure Land.

11
00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:38.030
Your mission: weigh up two ideals, and
decide what each one is really aiming at.
